  m_text: "Tending is a self-care companion for people navigating C-PTSD, informed
    by current research on trauma recovery.\n\nIt is not a substitute for professional
    mental health care. If you are in crisis, please call or text 988 (Suicide &
    Crisis Lifeline) or contact your local emergency services.\n\nDesigned and created
    by Steven Wallace \nHack for Humanity Summer 2026 submission"
